<div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="scroll-m-20 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl">
        The Joke Tax Chronicles
    </h1>
    <p class="leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6">
        Once upon a time, in a far-off land, there was a very lazy king who spent his days lounging on his throne. One day, his advisors came to him with a problem: the kingdom was running out of money.
    </p>
    <h2 class="scroll-m-20 border-b pb-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight first:mt-0">
        The People of the Kingdom
    </h2>
    <p class="leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6">
        The king's subjects were not amused. They grumbled and complained, but the king was firm:
    </p>
    <blockquote class="mt-6 border-l-2 pl-6 italic">
        "After all," he said, "everyone enjoys a good joke, so it's only fair that they should pay for the privilege."
    </blockquote>
    <h2 class="scroll-m-20 border-b pb-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight first:mt-0">
        The Joke Tax
    </h2>
    <p class="leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6">
        The king, seeing as he was wont to do, decided that he would tax the jokes in the kingdom.
    </p>
    <h3 class="scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">The Tax Rates</h3>
    <div class="my-6 w-full overflow-y-auto">
        <table class="w-full">
            <thead>
                <tr class="m-0 border-t p-0 even:bg-muted">
                    <th class="border px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">King's Treasury</th>
                    <th class="border px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">People</th>
                    <th class="border px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">Laughter</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr class="m-0 border-t p-0 even:bg-muted">
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">1st level of puns</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">50</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">5 gold coins</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="m-0 border-t p-0 even:bg-muted">
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">2nd level of jokes</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">200</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">10 gold coins</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="m-0 border-t p-0 even:bg-muted">
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">3rd level of one-liners</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">500</td>
                    <td class="border px-4 py-2 text-left [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right">20 gold coins</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <h3 class="scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">The People Beneath the Stairs</h3>
    <p class="leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6">
        The king's subjects rallied. They raised their concerns in the form of a petition:
    </p>
    <ul class="my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2">
        <li>1st level of puns: <code class="relative rounded bg-muted px-[0.3rem] py-[0.2rem] font-mono text-sm font-semibold">5 gold</code></li>
        <li>2nd level of jokes: <code class="relative rounded bg-muted px-[0.3rem] py-[0.2rem] font-mono text-sm font-semibold">10 gold</code></li>
        <li>3rd level of one-liners: <code class="relative rounded bg-muted px-[0.3rem] py-[0.2rem] font-mono text-sm font-semibold">20 gold</code></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="scroll-m-20 border-b pb-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight first:mt-0">Footnotes</h2>
    <p class="leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6">
        The king did not laugh. But he did decrease the joke tax from
        <code class="relative rounded bg-muted px-[0.3rem] py-[0.2rem] font-mono text-sm font-semibold">30%</code>
        to
        <code class="relative rounded bg-muted px-[0.3rem] py-[0.2rem] font-mono text-sm font-semibold">20%</code>.
    </p>
</div>
